%% title: Who sees what
%% desc: The school's data is one set. The admin sees and sets up everything. A teacher sees their own sections. An accountant sees fees and payments. A parent or student sees only their own information.
flowchart LR
  D["School data"]:::note --> A["Admin<br/>sees everything"]:::admin
  D --> T["Teacher<br/>own sections"]:::teacher
  D --> F["Accountant<br/>fees, payments"]:::admin
  D --> P["Parent, student<br/>only their own"]:::guardian
  classDef teacher fill:#e7f5ff,stroke:#1c7ed6,color:#0b3d66
  classDef admin fill:#fff4e6,stroke:#e8590c,color:#7a2e05
  classDef guardian fill:#ebfbee,stroke:#2b8a3e,color:#14411d
  classDef note fill:#f1f3f5,stroke:#868e96,color:#343a40
